	<string>Zastavka uses Photos only if needed so you can set an unlocked image as wallpaper from the iOS share sheet (Use as Wallpaper). The app cannot set Lock or Home wallpaper by itself.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Zastavka uses Photos only if needed so you can set an unlocked image as wallpaper from the iOS share sheet (Use as Wallpaper). The app cannot set Lock or Home wallpaper by itself.</string>
